{"connection_id": "BC-9bccc2e9791793074652", "ref": "SBLGNT:Jas.1.3", "target": "sec3", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "trial produces endurance", "note": "The commentary places sabr after the human's pressured loss; James says testing faith produces endurance, stating the productive sequence behind the commentary's pressed remedy."}
